      "text": "| Axis | F# |\n|------|-----|\n| Binding | Early (static) + .NET vtable for OOP interop |\n| Typing | Static |\n| Strength | Strong |\n| Type system | Nominal; structural for anonymous records |\n| Type inference | **Full HM** — annotate rarely |\n| Memory model | GC (.NET, same as C#) |"
